World Game is a very rough draft of an ASCII art based survival crafting game that I made for as9! The main mechanics of the game currently includes walking around and picking up items, but the plans for the future
include a full crafting system as well as building and combat mechanics! The controls for the game are extremely simple, just using WASD to move around and ENTER to open the inventory. There is no real
goal for the game, just exploring the grid you're in and collecting resources. It's not a lot and it's not super flashy, but it was a fun project and something I'd love to continue growing!
